│ with antidepressants, psychological therapies, or a combination.                                                     │
│                                                                                                                      │
│ CRITICAL OUTPUT REQUIREMENT:                                                                                         │
│ You MUST provide exactly 34 individual decision objects - ONE for EACH study in the candidates list.                 │
│ - Do NOT summarize excluded studies together                                                                         │
│ - Do NOT group decisions                                                                                             │
│ - Each study (by index) must have its own separate decision object with INCLUDE or EXCLUDE status and rationale      │
│ - Output must be parseable as a complete list of 34 decisions                                                        │
